<title>JAPAN: Matsumoto Denki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsumoto Denki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.98		vs	   10.45</p>
<p> Operating	    8    million	  vs	   34    million</p>
<p> Current	    126    million	  vs	  112    million</p>
<p> Net		   58    million	  vs	   63    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.20 yen	  vs	   15.40 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsumoto Denki Co Ltd is a local distributor of electric appliances.</p>
